<title>BRAZIL: Brazil's CNI to announce 1996 industry sales.</title>
<headline>Brazil's CNI to announce 1996 industry sales.</headline>
<dateline>BRASILIA 1997-02-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brazil's National Industry Confederation (CNI) said it will announce data relating to 1996 industrial sales at a news conference on Tuesday.</p>
<p>The news conference will begin at 1100 local/1300 GMT, the CNI said in a statement.</p>
<p>(( --William Schomberg, Brasilia newsroom 5561 2230358))</p>
